  <data name="Basic_WhenToUse" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>&lt;gcds-text&gt;For use on ASP.Net GC applications.&lt;/gcds-text&gt;
&lt;gcds-text&gt;The basic page template is for non-specialized pages across Canada.ca and is an optional template. It has the starting elements needed for a simple page and those required for most GC pages and applications. You can use it as a canvas to add or combine &lt;a href="{0}"&gt;components&lt;/a&gt; from GCFoundation (via TagHelpers) and the GC Design System.&lt;/gcds-text&gt;</value>
  </data>
